<push_retry>
  If the push fails, read the error message and fix the cause before retrying.
{% if branch_rename_allowed | default(true) %}  Common causes include invalid commit messages and rejected branch names — adjust whichever the error indicates.
{% else %}  The commit message is the only cause you can fix: the branch is already pushed, so report a rejected branch name as a failure instead of retrying it.
{% endif %}  You may attempt a maximum of 5 retries. If all attempts fail, report the failure.
  Do not proceed to subsequent steps until the push succeeds or all retries are exhausted.
</push_retry>
